{"seq":1,"slug":"bff-patterns-aggregation","title":"BFF 模式与聚合层设计","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation","rating":{"composite":3.58,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"bff-模式与聚合层设计-简介\">BFF 模式与聚合层设计 简介</h1><p>BFF（Backend for Frontend）是介于前端与后端微服务之间的专属编排层，为每类前端体验聚合下游数据、裁剪字段、塑造视图模型，把客户端的多次往返与编排负担搬到服务端。本 hub 面向日常构建 BFF 与聚合层的后端工程师，覆盖 BFF 的定位与取舍、扇出聚合与部分失败降级、客户端驱动的契约与版本协商，以及缓存性能、鉴权安全、可观测性与测试等生产实践。贯穿全程的纪律是：BFF 应当薄——只编排与塑形，不沉淀业务决策。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bff-foundations","title":"Bff Foundations","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/bff-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-bff","title":"什么是 BFF（Backend for Frontend）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/bff-foundations/what-is-bff"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bff-vs-api-gateway","title":"BFF 与 API 网关的区别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/bff-foundations/bff-vs-api-gateway"},{"seq":3,"slug":"when-to-use-bff","title":"何时该用 BFF，何时不该","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/bff-foundations/when-to-use-bff"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"aggregation-design","title":"Aggregation Design","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/aggregation-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fan-out-aggregation","title":"扇出与聚合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/aggregation-design/fan-out-aggregation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"response-shaping","title":"响应整形与视图模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/aggregation-design/response-shaping"},{"seq":3,"slug":"partial-failure-handling","title":"部分失败与降级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-ag